  "description": "A clean, dependency injection-first provider for filesystem access in .NET applications using System.IO.Abstractions. Features thread-safe operations, async context isolation, lazy initialization, and factory pattern for easy testing with mock filesystems. Built for modern .NET dependency injection.",
